Overview
The parking management app is a proposed software development project with the purpose of improving the management of parking facilities through a centralized and organized digital system. 

Problem:
Traditional parking operations involve manual processses, that can be tedious to go through, often not in a centralized system and requiring a mix of different communication between users/ customers and parking operators.
Our Parking Apps Centralized application could help improve operational efficiency, organize parking information, and simplify administrative responsibilies

Solution:
Our parking app will be an all encompassing app featuring : User and operator interfaces, secure login and authentication, backend management functions for customers and operators, and reporting functions for parking operations.

Project Acquisition Approach
Will be initiated through stakeholder approval of its scope , obj, schedule and estimated budget. Development will be carried out by a software project team consisting of the Project Manager, Devs, Business analyst, UX designer, QA tester, DEVOPS specialist, and SME(Subject Matter Expert). 
The estimated development timeline is seven months. 

Benefits
- Reduction in administrative workload, improvement of the organization of parking information, simplify user interactions, provide operators with useful reporting capabilities

Conclusion
Developing the Parking Management App offers an opportunity to modernize parking operations through accessible and centralized software. Project approval would depend on stakeholder agreement regarding the budget, resources and development timeline. 
